{"sections":[{"slug":"停机问题","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"停机问题"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">停机问题</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"停机问题"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">假设存在程序</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>\n$$\r\nH(P,I) := \\begin{cases}\r\n    1 &amp; P(I) \\downarrow\\\\\r\n    0 &amp; P(I) \\uparrow.\r\n\\end{cases}\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">构造程序</span> $H^+$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足对任意程序</span> $P$,\n$$\r\nH^+(P) \\downarrow \\quad\\Leftrightarrow\\quad P(P) \\uparrow.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">令</span> $P=H^+$, <span lang=\"zh\">则有</span>\n$$\r\nH^+(H^+) \\downarrow\\,\\Leftrightarrow H^+(H^+) \\uparrow,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">矛盾</span>.</p>\n"}}}]}